00:00:53.061 --> 00:00:59.101
The box she measured is 3.4 inches tall, and 4.2 inches across, and it weighs 9 tenths

00:00:59.101 --> 00:01:00.501
of a pound with the power cable.

00:01:01.041 --> 00:01:03.761
Audio is a 58-millimeter full-range driver

00:01:03.761 --> 00:01:05.461
throwing sound in a full circle.

00:01:05.981 --> 00:01:09.061
It connects over Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.4,

00:01:09.361 --> 00:01:12.661
and Thread 1.3 with three far-field microphones

00:01:12.661 --> 00:01:15.521
and a 30-watt USB-C adapter on a cord.

00:01:16.201 --> 00:01:19.321
Colors are berry, porcelain, hazel, and jade.

00:01:19.761 --> 00:01:22.381
She added it in the Google Home app in under five minutes.

00:01:22.921 --> 00:01:26.041
With Gemini, she set schedules, had her calendar read back,

00:01:26.041 --> 00:01:29.681
held a conversation, and cut the assistant off mid-sentence.

00:01:30.121 --> 00:01:33.041
It can also sync to other smart devices already in the house.

00:01:33.621 --> 00:01:35.861
Some of those controls need Google Home Premium.

00:01:36.481 --> 00:01:40.601
On the advanced plan, she says you can search camera history or get a home brief of what

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:41.901
the house did while you were out.

